            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that the ordinary statutory review scheme does not preclude a district court from entertaining these extraordinary constitutional claims."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
