            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 31,
              "start": 31
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, monetary penalties and property\u2011related orders implicate core private rights and should be adjudicated by Article\u202fIII courts."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
