            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 33,
              "start": 33
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, the Thunder Basin \u201ccomprehensive review\u201d test does not automatically bar district\u2011court jurisdiction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
