            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 34,
              "start": 34
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Gorsuch, congress, not the judiciary, defines the scope of federal jurisdiction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e6dbc4d8ce60054bebdcdf7f71366f207d657e106ca7734bb4c2acf18af99dd6",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-e6dbc4d8ce60-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Thomas, the claims are not of the type the statutory review schemes reach; a district court can therefore review them."
      }
